# Acyclic edge-colouring of disguised circular ladders

Paper: Manu Basavaraju and L. Sunil Chandran, [“Acyclic Edge Coloring of
2-degenerate Graphs”](https://arxiv.org/abs/0803.2433) (arXiv:0803.2433v2).

> **Completion status:** the generator and every local gate pass, but the
> mandatory four-vendor oracle run is not complete. OpenRouter rejected every
> request with HTTP 403, `Key limit exceeded (total limit)`, before a model
