The optimized audit has reached the full 200,000-sample run and the strengthened relabel-invariant diversity check. The latter initially exposed one collision in a weak degree/intersection key; I strengthened it with exact Gram-matrix spectral moments, and 20/20 unrelated shipping instances now separate while all required relabellings remain invariant.
