codex
The revised local measurements are substantially cleaner: the shipping graph has 3,937,562,500 bounded candidates and exactly 1,024 valid certificates, while the reference enumeration uses up to 13,757 membership tests and the invariant route uses 152 operations. The witness is now four integers (31 characters), so escalation grows `n` without growing the answer. I’m restarting the bare harness against this revised contract; the OpenRouter quota may still be the external blocker.
