codex
A stricter G4 audit caught another issue before shipping: the intercept is forced to be a neighbor of row 0, so sampling it from all residues overstated the search space. I’m correcting the candidate prior and raising the shipping modulus while keeping the four-atom witness fixed; this is exactly the “structure-aware” adjustment the gate requires.
apply patch
