Implemented a native Track B generator based on Section 4, Proposition 4.1 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.05218).

Key results:

- Four-integer symbolic triangle-factor certificate.
- Structure-aware guess rate: `1/1,200,000`; exact probability `4.386e-7`.
- Reference search: up to 32,490 membership tests.
- Compact route: 94 exact operations.
- All local G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- Answer size: 34 characters, 4 atoms.

